{"version":1,"key":"card:36","content":{"id":36,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在浏览器中通过 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"window.innerWidth","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 获取屏幕宽度时，有的手机在微信上面获得的数字相比于其它应用获得的数字偏小。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"我的手机是 Redmi K40S，在高德上的屏幕大小是 393，在微信上获得的大小是 360。试过了很多办法，微信上都是偏小的。"}],"disableDrag":false}],"tags":["踩坑/DOM","DOM/踩坑"],"createTime":1688964180842,"updateTime":1752924429146,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1752924429146}}